      "x": -40,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 640,
      "label": "Phase 1 \u00b7 What",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 760,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 640,
      "label": "Phase 2 \u00b7 How",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "g3",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 640,
      "label": "Phase 3 \u00b7 Build",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": -340,
      "width": 2340,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# VPDS pipeline\nOne AI, four personas, files as the only hand-off. **Fresh session after every \ud83d\udea6.**\nDashboard: [[changes.base]] \u00b7 Duplicate this canvas per change and drag that change's files next to each card.\nCheck any time: `node vpds/gate.mjs status`"
    },
    {
      "id": "pm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## \ud83e\udded PM\n`/vp:pm <idea>`\n\n\u2192 `proposal.md`\nWhy \u00b7 what \u00b7 acceptance criteria\nSets **tier**: small \u00b7 medium \u00b7 large",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "ux",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfa8 Designer *(large only)*\n`/vp:design <id>`\n\n\u2192 `ux.md`\nFlows \u00b7 screens \u00b7 states \u00b7 a11y",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## \ud83d\udea6 Gate 1 *(large)*\n```\nnode vpds/gate.mjs approve <id>\n```\nApproves proposal + ux, then `/clear`",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "arch",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 400,
      "text": "## \ud83c\udfdb Architect\n`/vp:architect <id>`\n\n\u2192 `design.md`\nDecisions \u00b7 data \u00b7 migrations \u00b7 API\n\n\u2192 `specs/<capability>/spec.md`\nDelta requirements + scenarios\n\n\u2192 `tasks.md`\nTest \u2192 Implement pairs\n\nMust pass `openspec validate <id> --strict`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## \ud83d\udea6 Gate 2 *(medium + large)*\n```\nnode vpds/gate.mjs approve <id>\n```\nLocks every file with a hash, then `/clear`",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 400,
      "text": "## \ud83e\uddea Developer / QA\n`/vp:build <id>`\n\nFirst: `gate.mjs check <id> build`\n\nPer task:\n\ud83d\udd34 failing test \u2192 \ud83d\udfe2 minimum code \u2192 \u267b refactor \u2192 \u2705 tick\n\nNever edits specs.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "archive",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "## \ud83d\udce6 Archive\nReview the diff, then\n```\nopenspec archive <id>\n```\nDeltas merge into `specs/`",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "pushback",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## \u21a9 Pushback\nSpec gap found while building \u2192\n`pushback.md` (`status: open`)\nBlocks build until the Architect resolves it and you approve again",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "small",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## \u26a1 Small tier\n`/vp:build \"fix \u2026\"`\nDeveloper writes a 1\u20133 task `tasks.md` + `skip_specs: true`.\nNo gates: review the diff.",
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
